{
  "info": {
    "name": "Coupon Service — Develop (rg-coupon-demo)",
    "description": "End-to-end tests for the **develop / non-prod** stack through Azure APIM.\r\n\r\n## Before you run\r\n\r\n1. Set **gatewayUrl** to your APIM gateway root (no trailing slash).\r\n   Discover: `az apim list -g rg-coupon-demo --query \"[0].gatewayUrl\" -o tsv`\r\n2. Acquire a token and paste into **bearerToken**:\r\n   `az account get-access-token --resource api://coupon-service --query accessToken -o tsv`\r\n3. (Optional admin folder) Set **adminSubscriptionKey** from APIM portal → Subscriptions → admin product.\r\n\r\n## Suggested order\r\n\r\nRun folder **1** → **2** → **3** top to bottom. Use Collection Runner for a one-click E2E pass.\r\n\r\nPowerShell alternative: `./scripts/test-deployed-apis.ps1 -GatewayUrl <gatewayUrl>`",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1 Health (no auth)",
      "item": [
        {
          "event": [
            {
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});"
                ]
              },
              "listen": "test"
            }
          ],
          "name": "GET health/live",
          "description": "Liveness.",
          "response": [],
          "request": {
            "url": "{{gatewayUrl}}/coupons/v1/health/live",
            "method": "GET",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "event": [
            {
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});"
                ]
              },
              "listen": "test"
            }
          ],
          "name": "GET health/ready",
          "description": "Readiness and startup seed check.",
          "response": [],
          "request": {
            "url": "{{gatewayUrl}}/coupons/v1/health/ready",
            "method": "GET",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "description": "Anonymous probes — run first."
    },
    {
      "name": "2 Coupons (Bearer token)",
      "item": [
        {
          "event": [
            {
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test(\"SAVE10 applied\", function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(body.status).to.eql(\"Applied\");",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test(\"Discount is 4.00 on 40.00 basket\", function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(Number(body.pricing.discount)).to.eql(4);",
                  "});"
                ]
              },
              "listen": "test"
            }
          ],
          "name": "POST preview — SAVE10",
          "description": "Advisory preview; 10% off €40 basket.",
          "response": [],
          "request": {
            "url": "{{gatewayUrl}}/coupons/v1/coupons/preview",
            "method": "POST",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"customerId\":\"postman-customer\",\"cart\":{\"lines\":[{\"lineId\":\"line-1\",\"category\":\"classic\",\"quantity\":2,\"unitPrice\":20.0,\"pizzaId\":\"margherita\"}]},\"confirmedOrderCount\":0,\"code\":\"SAVE10\"}"
            },
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "event": [
            {
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test(\"OLDCODE rejected\", function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(body.status).to.eql(\"Rejected\");",
                  "});"
                ]
              },
              "listen": "test"
            }
          ],
          "name": "POST preview — OLDCODE rejected",
          "description": "Business rejection still returns HTTP 200.",
          "response": [],
          "request": {
            "url": "{{gatewayUrl}}/coupons/v1/coupons/preview",
            "method": "POST",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"customerId\":\"postman-customer\",\"cart\":{\"lines\":[{\"lineId\":\"line-1\",\"category\":\"classic\",\"quantity\":1,\"unitPrice\":20.0,\"pizzaId\":\"margherita\"}]},\"confirmedOrderCount\":0,\"code\":\"OLDCODE\"}"
            },
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "description": "Customer product through /coupons. Set collection variable bearerToken first."
    },
    {
      "name": "3 Orders (Bearer token)",
      "item": [
        {
          "event": [
            {
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "pm.test(\"Has pizzas\", function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.json().pizzas.length).to.be.above(0);",
                  "});"
                ]
              },
              "listen": "test"
            }
          ],
          "name": "GET pizzas catalog",
          "description": "Catalog from data/pizzas.json.",
          "response": [],
          "request": {
            "url": "{{gatewayUrl}}/orders/v1/pizzas",
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "event": [
            {
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Order created\", function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200, 201]);",
                  "});",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200 || pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"orderId\", body.orderId);",
                  "    pm.test(\"Server priced total\", function () {",
                  "        pm.expect(Number(body.total)).to.eql(27.9);",
                  "    });",
                  "}"
                ]
              },
              "listen": "test"
            }
          ],
          "name": "POST place order — SAVE10",
          "description": "Server re-prices; clientTotal is ignored. Saves orderId variable.",
          "response": [],
          "request": {
            "url": "{{gatewayUrl}}/orders/v1/orders",
            "method": "POST",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"customerId\":\"postman-customer\",\"lines\":[{\"quantity\":2,\"pizzaId\":\"margherita\"},{\"quantity\":1,\"pizzaId\":\"bbq-chicken\"}],\"clientTotal\":1.0,\"couponPolicy\":\"AllowWithoutDiscount\",\"couponCode\":\"SAVE10\"}"
            },
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "event": [
            {
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test(\"Order id matches\", function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(body.orderId).to.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get(\"orderId\"));",
                  "});"
                ]
              },
              "listen": "test"
            }
          ],
          "name": "GET order by id",
          "description": "Uses orderId from place order.",
          "response": [],
          "request": {
            "url": "{{gatewayUrl}}/orders/v1/orders/{{orderId}}",
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "description": "Customer product through /orders. Run Place order before Get order."
    },
    {
      "name": "4 Admin (optional)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET admin policies",
          "description": "List seeded policies.",
          "response": [],
          "request": {
            "url": "{{gatewayUrl}}/admin/v1/admin/policies",
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key",
                "value": "{{adminSubscriptionKey}}"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET policy engine manifest",
          "description": "Engine capability manifest.",
          "response": [],
          "request": {
            "url": "{{gatewayUrl}}/admin/v1/policy-engine/manifest",
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key",
                "value": "{{adminSubscriptionKey}}"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "description": "Requires Coupon.Admin on the token AND admin APIM subscription key (Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key)."
    }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "type": "string",
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{bearerToken}}"
      }
    ]
  },
